\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Office Killer</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1996, he was the prime suspect in a horrific murder that remains unsolved. After the incident, he managed to cover his tracks, living under false identities and withdrawing completely from society. He lives his new life in the office of a company where no one will notice him, working the night shift and living in a data center room isolated from the outside world, which is forbidden to enter except for this person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the outside, he looks like an ordinary employee, but on the inside his dark tendencies have never disappeared. During his time in the office corridors, his psychological state has deteriorated and his paranoia and obsessions have increased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dealing with this villain will be a bit difficult because he can hear the sounds in every room through his unique camera system, which is also a sensitive audio listener and has many features. He will never give up until he catches you, so don't get caught and if there is noise in the rooms, find a place to hide before he sees you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mia's ghost</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After her tragic death, Mia's ghost has found no peace and is filled with rage. The office building is one of the killer's past hideouts, where Mia's energy is somehow trapped. However, Mia will not help you directly, but will be both a threat and a source of clues with its unstable and different personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813900/extras/0908840ce6f08b71f6ccc4402849771b.poster.avif?t=1752085288\" width=616 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shar